        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="PARTIAL_SCOPE_OR_ACCEPTANCE: own() only reads persisted payroll; it does not prepare, accept, complain about or close a statement. The older SRS three-day acceptance/closure is not implemented. No command key, source claim, money mutation or transaction commit belongs to this GET. FT10m/PT3m gross monthly and FT40h/PT20h are approved terms; availability is not attendance." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
